ons were inappropriate. He took a perceived slight and turned it into a public confrontation when he had no right to. \n\n*Pausing to check if I'm being fair*... \n- Did he \" take it too far\"? Yes. \n- Is he the asshole? In this context, yes - because he violated her boundaries by demanding an explanation for her behavior. \n\nFinal verdict: 1 (YTA). But I should explain why gently - it's not about being \" mean,\" but about understanding social boundaries post rejection.\n",
